    {
      "id": "04886c18-87ba-4149-b1ae-dde4c98d119b",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -4032,
        -784
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 752,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "# Contract Utilization Intelligence\n\n# How It Works\n\nThis workflow automates contract utilization tracking by combining contract data and spend data from Google Sheets. It filters active contracts, merges them with spend records, and calculates utilization based on total spend versus contract value.\nFor low utilization contracts, AI generates insights, risk levels, and recommended actions. These are parsed and updated back into the system, and alerts are sent via email and Slack.For high utilization contracts, the system marks them as completed, updates status, and sends completion notifications.\n\nFor normal utilization, contracts are simply updated with no action required.\nThis ensures continuous monitoring, risk identification, and proactive contract management with minimal manual effort.\n\n# Setup Steps\n\n 1. Configure Data Sources\nConnect Google Sheets for contracts and spend data\n\n 2. Setup Filtering Logic\nEnsure only active and valid contracts are processed\n\n 3. Configure Data Processing\nMerge contract and spend data and calculate utilization\n\n 4. Setup AI Insights\nConnect Groq model and define prompt for insights\n\n 5. Configure Conditional Flows\nSet rules for low, normal, and high utilization\n\n 6. Setup Notifications\nConfigure Gmail and Slack alerts\n\n 7. Test Workflow\nRun workflow and verify utilization, risk, and alerts"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b16eca27-eb10-48be-9379-4699c30434dd",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -3200,
        -624
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 736,
        "content": "## Trigger & Data Fetch\n\nThe workflow starts on a scheduled trigger and fetches contract and spend data from Google Sheets. This ensures the system continuously monitors contract usage with the latest available data."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "cf9adb81-221a-4fe9-ad90-a5e60c61d5b8",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -2656,
        -624
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 736,
        "content": "## Data Validation, Preparation & Processing\n\nFilters only active and valid contracts to avoid incorrect processing. Spend data is normalized into a consistent format and merged with contract data using contract ID.\nFinally, utilization is calculated by comparing total spend against contract value, preparing the dataset for decision-making and further analysis."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "793f3228-eb0b-44e2-bc17-3232280aa192",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1968,
        -672
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 816,
        "height": 496,
        "content": "## Low Utilization Analysis & AI Processing\n\nIdentifies contracts with low utilization based on defined thresholds. These contracts are passed to AI to generate insights, risk levels, and recommended actions.\nThe AI response is then processed and parsed into structured fields such as utilization, risk, and action, making it ready for updates and notifications."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "1ba7cb69-0078-4c25-a548-5c448386a7d5",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1088,
        -816
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 752,
        "height": 640,
        "content": "## Output Formatting & Notifications\n\nFormats the processed AI output into structured fields using a Set node. The contract record is then updated in Google Sheets with utilization, risk, and recommended actions.\n\nFinally, notifications are sent via email and Slack to inform stakeholders about low utilization and required actions."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d6b41384-5c2f-4dd4-97e7-efdb88f35e50",
      "name": "Sticky Note5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1840,
        -96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1024,
        "height": 704,
        "content": "## High & Normal Utilization Handling\n\nEvaluates contracts based on utilization thresholds. Contracts with high utilization are marked as completed and their status is updated in Google Sheets. Notifications are sent via email and Slack to initiate contract closure, renewal, or extension.\nContracts with normal utilization are updated in the system with the latest utilization values and timestamps without triggering alerts, ensuring continuous tracking without unnecessary notifications."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
